WEBVTT

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:05.330
Won't leave

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:11.040
Without a dropkick on her

00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:17.210
Zazas Zazas Nasatanada Zazas

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:32.230
-She summoned me, the evil god
-Evil god

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:34.770
-I gotta kill her or else
-What?

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:36.650
-I can't go back to hell
-Sister...

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:40.360
Yeah, yeah, yeah
Life next to death, I combat with my chainsaw

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:42.240
If you go too far

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:46.240
I'll slice you up completely

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:48.620
Your halo
Must get it back

00:00:48.830 --> 00:00:52.660
-Never miss a chance
-Hey, seriously?

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:56.960
-To attack her from behind
-You're so mean

00:00:57.170 --> 00:01:01.090
I'll never give up

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:02.840
Yurine, you're off your guard!

00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:06.930
Now!
Time to finish you with the Royal Copenhagen!

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:09.850
Huh? What? I missed...

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:13.270
Can't leave Earth

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:18.360
Without a dropkick on her

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:21.570
But until then

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:27.490
-Let's all have fun together
-Yeah!

00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:38.250
Wish I could stop by the arcade.

00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:42.090
The new mango figure
was just released.

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:45.220
But since I bought
refrigerated groceries,

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:46.640
I really can't.

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:50.600
-Poor me. I want a mango figure.
-Here she comes.

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:53.890
Since it's the perfect weather...

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:04.610
Over here!

00:02:05.150 --> 00:02:07.530
What do you think
of my Light Sword?

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:08.740
Sword?

00:02:08.950 --> 00:02:11.120
This is payback for last time.

00:02:11.410 --> 00:02:13.250
-Potato!
-Potato?

00:02:13.410 --> 00:02:15.750
Hey! I'm Jashin-chan, not Potato!

00:02:15.910 --> 00:02:18.120
Who the hell are you anyway?

00:02:19.210 --> 00:02:23.260
I'm Poporon, the angel you threw
over the cliff and into the ocean.

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:32.350
I can't recall...

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:34.890
How could you forget?

00:02:36.230 --> 00:02:40.520
That's Yurine's Polar Bear almond jelly!
How could you?

00:02:40.730 --> 00:02:43.780
Not my problem.
Are you even listening to me?

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:46.780
This is bad. This is really bad.

00:02:47.530 --> 00:02:50.280
Grocery shopping isn't that hard.

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:55.000
It hurts!

00:02:57.710 --> 00:03:01.790
Damn it! First you spill my curry
and now my almond jelly?

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:03.800
-Not my problem.
-Damn you!

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:08.720
If I knew this was gonna happen,
I would've just gone to the arcade!

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:12.100
-I would've gotten that mango!
-As an angel,

00:03:12.260 --> 00:03:14.310
I can't allow myself lose to a devil.

00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:17.100
My mango. My precious mango...

00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:18.390
Listen to me!

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:23.940
You devils are painful to look at!
A worthless, inferior species!

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:25.320
Get out of my sight!

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:26.820
Nope.

00:03:27.030 --> 00:03:28.570
-Do it!
-Nope.

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:30.820
I refuse to obey you.

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:34.080
I've had it! Now you're going to die!

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:40.830
Impressed? I trained to stop swords
with my bare hands, just in case.

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:43.790
But why? You're okay...?

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:45.300
That thorn got you...

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:47.460
That hurts!

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:49.050
Such an idiot.

00:03:49.470 --> 00:03:53.180
You treat devils like shit
because you think you're superior?

00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:55.430
You don't deserve
to be an angel!

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:07.650
What's happening?
I feel so much energy!

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:11.740
Now that I've absorbed angel powers,

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:14.990
I'm Super Jashin-chan,
a fusion of justice and evil!

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:16.990
The halo had that kind of power?

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:20.370
Just kidding.

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:22.830
It only lit up for a second.

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:24.630
How disappointing.

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:28.250
Without my halo,
I can't use my powers!

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:29.960
Victory!

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:32.630
So, what was that about the Light Sword?

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:36.220
Without your powers,
that's just a thorny bat.

00:04:36.390 --> 00:04:38.390
What are you gonna do, huh?

00:04:38.970 --> 00:04:43.060
I guess it's our time, the devils,
the inferior species, to shine!

00:04:43.230 --> 00:04:44.520
How exciting!

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:46.730
Here I go!

00:04:46.940 --> 00:04:50.860
You better brace yourself!

00:04:51.950 --> 00:04:54.950
Why so serious?
Come on, it was all a joke.

00:04:55.240 --> 00:04:57.490
Angels and devils,
we should all be friends!

00:04:58.120 --> 00:04:59.830
Say no to Armageddon!

00:04:59.990 --> 00:05:01.500
See you later!

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:04.370
Pretty devious for an angel.

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:07.960
-She reminds me of someone.
-Her!

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:09.170
Oh, yeah.

00:05:09.340 --> 00:05:11.260
The Polar Bear almond jelly...

00:05:12.630 --> 00:05:15.010
She'll be furious.

00:05:16.390 --> 00:05:18.510
The perfect weapon for an angel.

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:27.150
Medusa showed me a great curry shop
the other day called Manten.

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:29.650
Their portions are huge. It's really good too.

00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:34.400
Yurine made me replace the poisoned cake
I was gonna give Minos.

00:05:35.950 --> 00:05:37.240
Oh, so where's Medusa?

00:05:37.410 --> 00:05:40.660
-She's out with some friend.
-Friend?

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:42.410
What's wrong?

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:44.790
Medusa has a friend?

00:05:45.460 --> 00:05:47.630
Besides me?

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:49.920
ATM.

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:52.050
I'M TOO BUSY FOR YOU,
AT THE MOMENT.

00:05:52.380 --> 00:05:54.090
That traitor!

00:05:54.260 --> 00:05:58.850
-Hey Jashin-chan. You there?
-Who is this other friend, anyway?

00:05:59.010 --> 00:06:00.810
Are you really gonna eat that?

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:05.690
Damn it! I'm gonna call her
and make her come here!

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:09.190
Daimaruyaki!

00:06:10.980 --> 00:06:12.690
Gotta split, it's time for my shift.

00:06:16.910 --> 00:06:20.700
You cunning bitch!
Who the hell are you seeing?

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:24.290
Who are you seeing besides me?

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:26.160
Seriously?

00:06:26.710 --> 00:06:28.790
How did you know?

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:30.080
So, it's true?

00:06:30.460 --> 00:06:34.090
You whore!
Now you show your true colors!

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:36.010
-Are you jealous?
-What?

00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:39.180
Medusa's free
to have other friends.

00:06:39.390 --> 00:06:41.720
Jealous? Not at all.

00:06:41.890 --> 00:06:44.930
I'm fine. I'm not bothered at all.

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:47.310
But, I just can't seem
to forgive her.

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:49.440
That's called jealously, my friend.

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:50.690
Now spill it!

00:06:50.860 --> 00:06:53.150
Who were you with,
you backstabber?

00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:54.780
Well...

00:06:56.900 --> 00:07:00.700
So, now you're feeling guilty
and can't find the words to say?

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:06.200
-You always said you loved me! Jeez!
-I'll be at the bookstore.

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:07.790
Not so fast!

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:11.540
You better listen to what
this bitch has to say!

00:07:11.710 --> 00:07:13.710
Shut up.

00:07:13.920 --> 00:07:15.420
You're so mean.

00:07:15.670 --> 00:07:18.720
Why do you keep calling me a bitch
and a backstabber?

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:20.930
Crying's not gonna help.

00:07:21.180 --> 00:07:24.310
Just give me an explanation.

00:07:25.310 --> 00:07:28.480
I thought I had to keep it to myself.

00:07:28.690 --> 00:07:31.560
-What?
-You told me not to tell.

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:33.150
A few days ago...

00:07:34.900 --> 00:07:39.490
I spent 5000 yen in an attempt
to get a prize at the arcade...

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:44.490
And all I got was a grape figure!
What a damn waste!

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:48.040
That's why I'm so worked up right now.

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:51.080
I used up all my allowance.

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:55.380
Medusa, do you love me?

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:59.630
What's the matter?
Of course I love you, Jashin-chan.

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:06.140
How will I survive when I'm so broke?
What am I supposed to do?

00:08:06.350 --> 00:08:07.770
Don't cry!

00:08:07.970 --> 00:08:11.230
-Don't worry, I'll work more.
-Really?

00:08:11.440 --> 00:08:13.270
I'll take care of you.

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:15.980
Really? That's so nice of you.

00:08:16.360 --> 00:08:20.400
-I wasn't expecting anything.
-It's okay.

00:08:20.610 --> 00:08:25.280
But don't say you're doing this for me,
that'll make me look bad.

00:08:25.450 --> 00:08:26.660
I won't, I promise.

00:08:27.830 --> 00:08:31.410
I lied to Minos to keep our secret.

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:35.040
But you put me on the spot
in front of Yurine...

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:41.050
You kept calling me a bitch
and accused me of being guilty.

00:08:41.380 --> 00:08:44.220
Yurine, we'll meet you
at the bookstore.

00:08:44.430 --> 00:08:45.800
Too late, huh?

00:08:46.050 --> 00:08:50.480
Sorry about the name-calling.
So, who called you a bitch?

00:08:50.680 --> 00:08:54.810
Come on, tell me.
I'll go beat them up.

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:58.270
-You're the worst!
-Jashin-chan.

00:08:58.780 --> 00:09:01.690
You really are the worst
of the worst.

00:09:01.860 --> 00:09:04.320
I actually feel bad for you.

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:07.870
Even for a devil, you're pretty low.

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:11.870
You're not going to do anything to me?

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:15.000
Medusa, I'll walk you to the station.

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:18.250
Munch.

00:09:21.090 --> 00:09:23.550
What is this feeling?

00:09:23.760 --> 00:09:27.430
That defeated look on Yurine's face...

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:32.350
She's basically saying I'm so worthless
I don't even deserve to be punished.

00:09:38.020 --> 00:09:40.270
My stomach's upset.

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:43.530
I can't take this humiliation!

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:48.830
Are you crying?

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:50.370
I am.

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:52.080
So you're puking.

00:09:52.410 --> 00:09:54.160
Clean up after yourself.

00:10:15.520 --> 00:10:16.560
Hello.

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:19.900
Hey!

00:10:20.150 --> 00:10:21.440
Minos.

00:10:22.610 --> 00:10:24.570
There's a message from Jashin-chan.

00:10:25.190 --> 00:10:27.070
It's for you, Medusa.

00:10:27.660 --> 00:10:29.370
Thank you for waiting.

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:33.950
Looking back at yesterday,

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:38.750
I think I may have been at fault,
just a tiny bit.

00:10:39.670 --> 00:10:43.920
To make up for it,
I'll give you my full attention today.

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:45.880
Meet me in Shibuya at 1.

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:47.720
See you there.

00:10:48.630 --> 00:10:50.260
Jashin-chan...

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:54.890
Since she's broke,
she caused a ruckus in front of my place

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:57.640
but I didn't notice because I was asleep.

00:10:57.890 --> 00:11:00.150
She left that note in my mailbox.

00:11:01.110 --> 00:11:03.650
It's okay!
That's why I'm working more.

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:07.400
I support Jashin-chan
when she's in need! See you!

00:11:07.740 --> 00:11:08.820
Hey, the curry!

00:11:08.990 --> 00:11:11.530
Sorry, could you eat it for me? Thanks!

00:11:11.740 --> 00:11:13.330
I'll leave the money here!

00:11:13.490 --> 00:11:15.660
-Thank you.
-Sweet!

00:11:15.870 --> 00:11:18.410
I'll wear that thing I bought last time!

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:20.960
I'm gonna surprise her!

00:11:22.670 --> 00:11:24.590
Weren't you going out?

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:27.920
I'm headed out soon.
We're meeting at 1.

00:11:28.130 --> 00:11:29.880
Must be one on the dot.

00:11:30.050 --> 00:11:31.180
Yeah, it is.

00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:33.680
That jingle!

00:11:33.890 --> 00:11:37.480
Congratulations, Jashin-chan.
You've reached the next level.

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:39.690
What's that?

00:11:39.850 --> 00:11:43.270
She's Tangan-chan.
A low-class messenger devil.

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:44.480
I see.

00:11:44.650 --> 00:11:49.570
Since you've reached the next level,
you've earned a reward.

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:51.320
All right!

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:53.740
What's gonna happen now?

00:11:54.280 --> 00:11:58.660
-I get a bunch of perks too.
-Perks?

00:11:58.870 --> 00:12:02.460
Let's see, free train passes,
luxury hotel vouchers...

00:12:02.790 --> 00:12:08.090
I also get generous supermarket coupons,
and a whole lot more!

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:10.590
Are you a stockholder or something?

00:12:11.050 --> 00:12:15.810
Hey, but I never killed anything
to advance to the next level.

00:12:15.970 --> 00:12:20.560
The other day, you stripped an angel
of her powers by eating her halo.

00:12:20.730 --> 00:12:23.060
That qualified you for advancement.

00:12:23.310 --> 00:12:26.230
Awesome!
I better eat more halos then!

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:30.110
Since you can't go back home to hell,

00:12:30.360 --> 00:12:34.240
Mr. Satan sent you this as a reward.

00:12:34.780 --> 00:12:36.280
What's that?

00:12:36.990 --> 00:12:38.740
Long story short,

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:41.750
that's a by-product
of Mr. Satan's research

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:44.750
-into black magic.
-It's a long story. Snack time.

00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:48.250
He used a secret method to produce

00:12:48.460 --> 00:12:51.260
this super uber exciting
cosmic concoction

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:53.260
that does wonders for your body.

00:12:53.890 --> 00:12:55.180
That's all.

00:12:56.100 --> 00:12:59.680
-This is the ultimate energy drink.
-Correct.

00:12:59.850 --> 00:13:02.600
Maybe I could kill Yurine now.

00:13:02.980 --> 00:13:04.900
My duties are done here.

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:07.270
This is goodbye!

00:13:08.110 --> 00:13:09.280
She exploded.

00:13:10.610 --> 00:13:14.910
Tangan-chan self-destructs
when her duties are done.

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:16.530
That's intense.

00:13:16.740 --> 00:13:19.990
But when a devil dies
in the human world,

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:24.000
they regenerate as a higher class devil
in hell, so it's all good.

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:28.880
Cheers to you, Tangan-chan.

00:13:33.050 --> 00:13:34.300
That stench!

00:13:34.590 --> 00:13:37.930
Is this really okay to drink?

00:13:38.140 --> 00:13:39.930
JASHIN-CHAN, DRINK UP!
FROM SATAN

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:45.520
It's probably not as bad as it smells.

00:13:45.690 --> 00:13:46.690
Right?

00:13:46.850 --> 00:13:50.230
If you're gonna drink it,
do it now. It stinks.

00:13:53.780 --> 00:13:56.700
That was horrible! Gross!

00:13:56.910 --> 00:13:59.450
-Disgusting!
-Unexpectedly bad, huh?

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:04.960
Yum, so good.

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:10.000
How dare you eat pudding
while I suffer? Give me a bite!

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:14.510
No way. I keep my dessert
all to myself.

00:14:14.670 --> 00:14:19.600
Damn it! I'm gonna get Medusa
to buy me all the sweets I want!

00:14:20.930 --> 00:14:22.270
What the hell?

00:14:22.430 --> 00:14:24.230
I tripped over nothing!

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:27.520
Jashin-chan, look at you.

00:14:34.690 --> 00:14:37.410
I bet it'll surprise her.

00:14:37.660 --> 00:14:38.740
Hey!

00:14:39.780 --> 00:14:42.410
Jashin-chan? Why are you wearing clothes?

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:44.290
You look so cute!

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:47.370
I'm not cute, I'm strong.

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:49.040
Sorry for the wait.

00:14:49.330 --> 00:14:51.130
No problem.

00:14:51.420 --> 00:14:53.380
I got here early.

00:14:53.670 --> 00:14:58.260
But I think people were starting
to get suspicious after a while.

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:02.010
Jashin-chan, you have legs!

00:15:02.390 --> 00:15:04.020
You finally noticed.

00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:06.270
Look at you.

00:15:07.600 --> 00:15:09.270
I grew legs!

00:15:09.520 --> 00:15:12.270
-Because of this?
-Must be.

00:15:12.730 --> 00:15:16.530
Growing legs will make me
more powerful, huh?

00:15:16.780 --> 00:15:20.160
You're making the animator's job hard
by being nude.

00:15:20.360 --> 00:15:21.780
Here, wear some clothes.

00:15:24.370 --> 00:15:26.830
Question. Is this underwear brand new?

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:28.790
Never worn!

00:15:29.620 --> 00:15:34.130
Medusa's gonna flip out
when she sees me like this.

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:37.300
So that's the story.
Is your mind blown?

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:41.550
That's amazing how you got
a reward like that from Mr. Satan!

00:15:41.760 --> 00:15:44.100
Hey, where's your paper bag?

00:15:46.520 --> 00:15:50.060
I'm wearing contacts
that prevent petrification.

00:15:50.270 --> 00:15:51.770
What? That's genius!

00:15:52.060 --> 00:15:56.070
Now you can walk around the human world
without a paper bag?

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:57.320
That's right!

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:00.490
I'm happy for you, Medusa.

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:03.780
Hey, Jashin-chan.

00:16:04.870 --> 00:16:08.910
I wanna wear clothes like you.
Help me pick something out.

00:16:17.460 --> 00:16:18.840
This one's cute.

00:16:19.130 --> 00:16:20.970
They all look the same to me.

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:22.930
How's this?

00:16:23.090 --> 00:16:24.930
Looks good on you.

00:16:25.100 --> 00:16:26.930
Really? Thanks.

00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:30.940
It feels so refreshing
to not have to wear a bag around town.

00:16:31.140 --> 00:16:34.900
This is a whole new world for me,
it's so fun.

00:16:35.060 --> 00:16:40.530
Medusa's having the time of her life.
She must have dreaded wearing the bag.

00:16:41.780 --> 00:16:46.200
Aren't you happy you grew legs too?
You seem to like them a lot.

00:16:46.410 --> 00:16:50.000
It's not that exciting.
I'm still getting used to them.

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:51.160
Look.

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:53.250
Angels in Shibuya.

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:56.290
Hey, lovely angels,
wanna go out with us?

00:16:56.460 --> 00:16:57.590
We're devils!

00:16:57.960 --> 00:16:59.420
-We got asked out.
-Help!

00:16:59.590 --> 00:17:02.680
Losers.
They don't even know who we are.

00:17:11.930 --> 00:17:16.940
-This is so cool. And yummy.
-I don't get humans. Is this cute?

00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:20.440
Let's go see that later.

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:22.860
What's that? It's huge.

00:17:23.070 --> 00:17:24.530
It's a unicorn!

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:29.240
Jashin-chan is here in Tokyo somewhere.

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:47.390
Jashin-chan, it's the ocean!

00:17:48.390 --> 00:17:49.430
Are you okay?

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:50.640
Need help?

00:17:50.810 --> 00:17:51.850
Hands off!

00:17:52.390 --> 00:17:53.930
Scram, you fools!

00:17:54.310 --> 00:17:57.770
-I'm still not used to these shoes.
-Are you okay?

00:17:58.270 --> 00:18:00.360
Medusa, your legs!

00:18:01.900 --> 00:18:03.570
What's happening...?

00:18:03.860 --> 00:18:05.570
They're petrifying!

00:18:06.280 --> 00:18:09.580
Let's move away from all the people.
Over there!

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:14.210
Could it be a side effect
from using those contact lenses?

00:18:15.580 --> 00:18:17.210
Take them out for a second.

00:18:22.590 --> 00:18:25.720
-The petrification is stopping.
-I knew it.

00:18:25.930 --> 00:18:29.430
Petrification isn't that easy to prevent.

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:32.350
You got ripped off
by these cheap bastards.

00:18:32.560 --> 00:18:35.230
I'll give them hell when I get back!

00:18:35.390 --> 00:18:36.940
I'm sorry, Jashin-chan.

00:18:37.350 --> 00:18:39.610
I just wanted us
to have a good time.

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:45.860
Instead I've upset you
and now I'm back to wearing the bag.

00:18:46.070 --> 00:18:47.740
Don't cry, Medusa!

00:18:48.110 --> 00:18:49.110
It's not...

00:18:49.780 --> 00:18:52.700
It's not a nuisance for me at all.

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:56.660
Plus, there might be another way
to prevent the petrification.

00:18:56.830 --> 00:18:58.370
Let's not give up.

00:19:00.710 --> 00:19:01.880
You're right.

00:19:02.090 --> 00:19:06.090
But that company's going down!
I'll never forgive them!

00:19:06.260 --> 00:19:09.800
How could they sell
such cheap product?

00:19:13.810 --> 00:19:16.640
What? Where am I?

00:19:17.810 --> 00:19:21.020
-I bought them from you.
-Thanks for your business!

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:25.780
You're the corrupt seller
of these contact lenses?

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:29.360
Dropkick in Odaiba!

00:19:30.450 --> 00:19:32.370
You brats!

00:19:33.240 --> 00:19:35.490
My dropkick is even more destructive!

00:19:35.660 --> 00:19:38.410
It might be powerful enough
to kill Yurine.

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:40.210
Thanks!

00:19:40.460 --> 00:19:42.750
Jashin-chan, you're so kind.

00:19:43.210 --> 00:19:45.130
What? Not at all.

00:19:45.300 --> 00:19:49.380
That's what he gets
for making you waste your money.

00:19:49.590 --> 00:19:52.180
And your money is my money!

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:53.970
Okay, okay.

00:19:56.720 --> 00:19:59.140
-We should head home soon.
-Yup.

00:19:59.390 --> 00:20:03.110
Sorry, but you gotta wear this bag again.

00:20:04.190 --> 00:20:05.400
Get on my back.

00:20:05.980 --> 00:20:09.320
You can't be walking
with those petrified legs.

00:20:11.570 --> 00:20:14.280
Thanks, Jashin-chan.
I hope I'm not too heavy.

00:20:14.450 --> 00:20:16.410
You are.
You should go on a diet.

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:18.330
Meanie...

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:22.040
I just felt something cold.
Did you just drool on me?

00:20:22.210 --> 00:20:23.790
I did not.

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:31.380
Snow? Well, that's out of season.

00:20:53.530 --> 00:20:54.570
What?

00:20:55.120 --> 00:20:58.290
You carried Medusa all the way home
from Odaiba?

00:20:58.490 --> 00:21:00.450
I'm pretty beat right now.

00:21:00.950 --> 00:21:02.000
Sorry.

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:04.710
So you're not completely hopeless after all.

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:06.170
Well, barely.

00:21:06.380 --> 00:21:09.550
Now that she thinks
there's a glimpse of good in me...

00:21:10.170 --> 00:21:12.800
My dropkick's deadly
thanks to these legs!

00:21:13.010 --> 00:21:14.430
Die, Yurine!

00:21:14.590 --> 00:21:17.680
This is gonna be the final episode!

00:21:17.890 --> 00:21:19.390
Jashin-chan Dropkick!

00:21:19.560 --> 00:21:23.100
The final one before we start airing
the series of highlights

00:21:23.270 --> 00:21:26.940
that was obviously put together
in a rush to make the deadline!

00:21:33.280 --> 00:21:35.280
What? My tail's back.

00:21:35.740 --> 00:21:38.580
I guess it only lasts
for a fixed period of time.

00:21:39.620 --> 00:21:41.330
Boy, that's a bummer.

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:44.620
But I feel like myself again!

00:21:45.040 --> 00:21:47.710
-I'll go make dinner now.
-Not so fast.

00:21:48.380 --> 00:21:52.050
I was actually a little proud of you earlier

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:54.550
but you had to ruin it, didn't you?

00:21:54.930 --> 00:21:57.180
You tried to kill me again.

00:21:58.010 --> 00:21:59.810
Now that your tail's back,

00:22:00.100 --> 00:22:03.270
why don't we serve live viper
for dinner tonight?

00:22:03.430 --> 00:22:04.810
Please don't!

00:22:04.980 --> 00:22:07.020
I don't wanna be eaten!

00:22:07.190 --> 00:22:09.820
Jashin-chan,
thank you for an amazing day.

00:22:31.000 --> 00:22:34.670
Dropkick on her, yeah her
I'll take you down again

00:22:34.840 --> 00:22:39.600
Hate you
Love doesn't exist in this world

00:22:40.260 --> 00:22:44.890
Fear the dropkick
An angel looks for her halo

00:22:45.100 --> 00:22:49.270
As she starves to death

00:22:49.480 --> 00:22:51.820
It's a love and hate relationship

00:22:52.150 --> 00:22:54.110
Can't leave each other alone

00:22:54.320 --> 00:22:58.780
Like a galaxy-bursting shooting star

00:22:58.990 --> 00:23:02.990
Slowly, slowly, sneak up and die

00:23:03.200 --> 00:23:05.410
Test my heart, don't stop

00:23:05.620 --> 00:23:12.460
Let's go, dream on
No matter human, angel or devil

00:23:12.670 --> 00:23:16.720
We're a happy family

00:23:17.090 --> 00:23:20.970
Let me say, I love you

00:23:21.180 --> 00:23:23.470
When all is said and done

00:23:23.680 --> 00:23:28.140
I'm home
Welcome back, it's hot pot tonight

00:23:28.350 --> 00:23:32.820
Come, gather everyone
Let's enjoy this meal

00:23:33.020 --> 00:23:35.070
For another crazy tomorrow

00:23:35.280 --> 00:23:38.780
What next? What next?
In the end, wake up

00:23:41.530 --> 00:23:44.410
Both have had their wings torn off
and have been traumatized.

00:23:44.620 --> 00:23:47.870
But they are completely the opposite.
Two completely different angels.

00:23:48.580 --> 00:23:50.420
And the devil goes beyond time.

00:23:50.750 --> 00:23:52.130
Dropkick on My Devil!

00:23:52.290 --> 00:23:55.300
We'll paro special into your heart
in the next episode too!
